sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: To apply a parallelogram equal to a given rectilinear figure to a given straight line but exceeding it by a parallelogram similar to a given one.
----
proof:

Let {C} be the given rectilinear figure, {AB} be the given straight line, and {D} the parallelogram to which the excess is required to be similar.

It is required to apply a parallelogram equal to the rectilinear figure {C}  to the straight line {AB} but exceeding it by a parallelogram similar to {D}.

